---
description: Core invariants for the TiendaMax tax compliance engine
alwaysApply: true
---

This repo is a graded take-home. Audit and review against these invariants
before proposing any change.

1. Money is ALWAYS integer minor units; rates are ALWAYS basis points. No floats.
2. `src/domain/` is pure: no db, no HTTP, no clock. Dependency arrow is
   api -> service -> db -> domain, inward only.
3. `tax_rule_versions` is append-only and BITEMPORAL:
   - valid_from / valid_to      selected by TRANSACTION DATE
   - recorded_at / superseded_at selected by AS-OF INSTANT
   Never merge the two axes. Never UPDATE a rate in place.
4. The audit trail is immutable (enforced by SQLite triggers) and records every
   request, including failures. Audit rows store BOTH rule version ids AND a
   full JSON snapshot of the rules used.
5. No applicable rule => 422 NO_APPLICABLE_RULE. Never a silent 0%.
6. Report aggregation happens in SQL, not in application memory.

When reviewing, prioritise in this order (matches the scoring rubric):
calculation accuracy (25) > audit trail (20) = rule versioning (20) >
API design (15) > code quality (10) = documentation (10).
